ts by that offset while the interval stays constant.\n\n**Fix:** Schedule based on wall-clock time. Instead of a fixed interval, calculate the delay until the next scheduled time (e.g., 3am local) and use `setTimeout` with recalculation:\n\n```js\nfunction scheduleNightly(run, hourOfDay = 3) {\n  function reschedule() {\n    const now = new Date();\n    const next = new Date();\n    next.setHours(hourOfDay, 0, 0, 0);\n    if (next <= now) next.setDate(next.getDate() + 1);\n    const delay = next - now;\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      run();\n      reschedule();\n    }, delay);\n  }\n  reschedule();\n}\n```\n\nThis recalculates the next scheduled time after each run, so DST shifts don't accumulate.","ttft_ms":6840,"type":"result","duration_ms":10918,"uuid":"c19d1572-6f89-4047-845d-f403b0b73f58","ttft_stream_ms":799,"time_to_request_ms":134,"first_content_frame_ms":799,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":1026,"cacheReadInputTokens":7215,"cacheCreationInputTokens":537,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0069355,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":567,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":537,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-12T05:14:51.381Z"}